# Manual-fix GUI outputs. These are regenerable measurements, not code or
# decisions, so they stay out of the repo (relocate with --measurements and
# --fix-plots). The override JSON is deliberately NOT ignored: it records the
# masking decisions that determine results, and versioning it is what makes a
# run reproducible from the repo alone.
ica/manual_fix_measurements.csv
ica/manual_fix_overrides.json.bak-*